            year: 2005,
            summary: "Pro wrestling\x92s most influential writers, Vince Russo and Ed Ferrara, have been in the middle of some of the most important angles, stories, and developments in the history of pro wrestling. For the first time ever, the former WWF, WCW, and TNA writers give an in-depth account of their lives and times INSIDE THE WORLD OF PRO WRESTLING! After watching this documentary, you\x92ll never look at pro wrestling or its top stars the same way again! Go behind the scenes at a wrestling show and see how writers script interviews, skits, and matches. See the finished product and then see how it all came together on this groundbreaking DVD! Plus, get behind the scenes stories on Vince McMahon, The Rock, Stone Cold Steve Austin, The Undertaker...",
